<p>The Dragon Age Toolset installer comes with several pieces of third-party software that are needed for the toolset to function. They are:
</p>
<ul><li> DirectX 9.0c</li>
<li> Visual C Runtime Library</li>
<li> Microsoft SQL Server Express 2005 Edition</li>
<li> Nvidia PhysX drivers version ONLY PhysX_9.09.0203_SystemSoftware</li>
<li> Phyton Version: ActivePython-2.5.5.7-win32-x86. Extremely important for Lightmapping</li></ul>
<p>These components will be installed along with the toolset by the toolset's installer.
</p>
